('FR-044:BE-01','FR-044','Accessibility Pipeline','BE-01','BE','Creates the wcag_techniques table via Flyway DDL migration and seeds it with all 1,551 WCAG technique-to-Axe-rule mappings from WCAG_Full_Mapping_ICE.xlsx. This table is the rule registry that drives profile resolution (BE-03) and violation enrichment (BE-05). The table stores: technique_id, criterion_id, criterion_name, wcag_level, axe_rule_id, domain, component_group, severity, help_url, and a runtime_filter flag.',1.5,'dep_on',10),
('FR-044:BE-02','FR-044','Accessibility Pipeline','BE-02','BE','Implements the import_wcag.py script that reads WCAG_Full_Mapping_ICE.xlsx and bulk-inserts all 1,551 rows into the wcag_techniques table. Skips header row, handles empty cells, deduplicates on (technique_id, axe_rule_id, domain). Also creates indexes on axe_rule_id, domain, wcag_level, and component_group for fast profile resolution queries. Run once at tenant provisioning or when WCAG mapping is updated.',0.75,'dep_on',10),
('FR-044:BE-03','FR-044','Accessibility Pipeline','BE-03','BE','Resolves the active accessibility profile for the current tenant at run start, querying the WCAG rule registry to build the Axe rule set.',1,'needs_fr',10),
('FR-044:BE-04','FR-044','Accessibility Pipeline','BE-04','BE','Implements AccessibilityWorker — the async validation worker that runs Axe accessibility checks as a library call inside ice-core-jar. Receives PageSnapshot from ValidationRunner thread pool. Calls AxeBuilder.analyze(driver) using the axe-selenium-java library, passing the resolved rule set from BE-03. Returns raw AxeResults to BE-05 for enrichment. Worker is stateless, catches all exceptions internally, never touches the main test WebDriver directly — uses the DOM snapshot from PageSnapshot to run Axe in an isolated context.',1.5,'needs_fr',10),
